config KEMU
	bool "kemu: run AArch64 Linux binaries (in-kernel emulation)"
	depends on X86_64 && RUST && GENERIC_ENTRY && BINFMT_ELF
	help
	  Transparently run AArch64 (arm64) Linux user-space programs on
	  x86_64 by translating them in the kernel. AArch64 ELF images are
	  executed directly by execve(); the guest sees an arm64 kernel ABI.

	  If unsure, say N.
